//! Port of `scanner/scanner.go` lines 1 to 1236: the `Scanner` struct and
//! state, `Scan`, comment directives and the rescans for `<`, `>`, `/`, `*=`
//! and templates.
//!
//! Go `rune` ports to `i32` (Go `char()` returns -1 at the end of the text).
